{"id":"MOEX-113020-2301-Q056","title":"四種抗癌抗體：HER2、EGFR與PD-1／PD-L1的位置","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med2","sourceSha256":"16e4f76cbb872d47980409484debe0783401c7e65a55f338ff642c46e3a13110","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_5a01acfb690c8191b3796bc453f98a37","sourceAnchor":"q56","shortHtml":"<p>答案是<strong>D</strong>。Pertuzumab針對的是<strong>人類表皮生長因子受體2（HER2）</strong>，不是血管內皮生長因子受體（VEGFR）。它結合HER2胞外的<strong>二聚化區域</strong>，阻礙HER2與其他HER家族受體配對，降低下游生長訊號。</p>","html":"<div><h2>四種抗癌抗體：HER2、EGFR與PD-1／PD-L1的位置</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：D</p><h3>Pertuzumab結合HER2，D把標靶寫錯</h3>\n<p>答案是<strong>D</strong>。Pertuzumab針對的是<strong>人類表皮生長因子受體2（HER2）</strong>，不是血管內皮生長因子受體（VEGFR）。它結合HER2胞外的<strong>二聚化區域</strong>，阻礙HER2與其他HER家族受體配對，降低下游生長訊號。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:706px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.0\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/be073b3a2a49c2964f3fb9e267883c5e13c6129fc0e0dd5a4125c5d66575ab70.jpg\" alt=\"Pertuzumab與trastuzumab結合HER2不同位置，pertuzumab阻礙HER2與其他HER受體二聚化\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"706\" height=\"706\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/be073b3a2a49c2964f3fb9e267883c5e13c6129fc0e0dd5a4125c5d66575ab70.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>看綠色pertuzumab與粉紅HER2：重點是<strong>結合HER2、阻礙受體配對</strong>。下方B區顯示trastuzumab與pertuzumab可結合不同位置；圖是機轉概括，不用紅叉推算各種二聚體受抑制的程度。圖：<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6210751/#cancers-10-00342-f003\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nami等（2018），Figure 3</a>；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>，完整原圖。</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>A、B：分清PD-1與它的配體PD-L1</h3>\n<p><strong>程序性死亡受體1（PD-1）</strong>是T細胞等免疫細胞上的抑制性受體；其配體<strong>PD-L1</strong>可出現在腫瘤細胞及其他細胞上。兩者結合可抑制T細胞反應，癌細胞因而可能逃避免疫攻擊。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:795px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.9485294117647058\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/483265a407be61e7238d22c2462a3743faeae65c58bb10acd7a34a3c091c55da.jpg\" alt=\"左側抗PD1抗體作用於T細胞受體，右側抗PDL1抗體作用於腫瘤及其他細胞的配體\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"795\" height=\"408\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/483265a407be61e7238d22c2462a3743faeae65c58bb10acd7a34a3c091c55da.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>左：anti-PD-1，對應nivolumab；右：anti-PD-L1，對應avelumab。</strong>圖同時畫出浸潤免疫細胞，提示PD-L1並非癌細胞專有。圖：<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7274131/#F1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chen等（2020），Figure 1</a>；<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7274131/#copyright\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY，來源未註版本</a>，完整原圖。</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>藥物</th><th>直接結合標靶</th><th>本題判讀</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>A　avelumab</td><td><strong>PD-L1</strong></td><td>正確；阻斷配體端，解除免疫抑制</td></tr>\n<tr><td>B　nivolumab</td><td><strong>PD-1</strong></td><td>正確；阻斷受體端，影響其與PD-L1／PD-L2互動</td></tr>\n<tr><td>C　panitumumab</td><td><strong>EGFR</strong>，即HER1</td><td>正確；直接作用於生長因子受體，與前題cetuximab同屬抗EGFR抗體</td></tr>\n<tr><td>D　pertuzumab</td><td><strong>HER2</strong></td><td>錯誤在將HER2換成VEGFR</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>順便分開HER家族與血管新生標靶</h3>\n<p>HER2與EGFR屬同一受體家族，但不是同一標靶；VEGF／VEGFR則是另一組與血管新生密切相關的訊號。常考對照是<strong>ramucirumab結合VEGFR-2</strong>，而<strong>bevacizumab結合VEGF配體</strong>。遇到抗體題，先確認「受體還是配體、哪一個分子」，再連回癌別，會比只背藥名字尾可靠。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（二）原題，第56題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-drug/def/pertuzumab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI：pertuzumab的HER2胞外二聚化標靶</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nciformulary.cancer.gov/available_agents/Avelumab.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI：avelumab結合PD-L1</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dctd.cancer.gov/drug-discovery-development/reagents-materials/formulary/about/agents/nivolumab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI：nivolumab結合PD-1並阻斷配體互動</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-terms/def/panitumumab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI：panitumumab結合EGFR</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-drug/def/ramucirumab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI：ramucirumab直接結合VEGFR-2</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cancer.gov/about-cancer/treatment/types/immunotherapy/angiogenesis-inhibitors-fact-sheet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI：血管新生抑制與VEGF相關藥物</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6210751/#cancers-10-00342-f003\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Babak Nami、Hamid Maadi、Zhixiang Wang：Pertuzumab抑制HER2異源二聚</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7274131/#F1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yu Chen、Yanqing Pei、Jingyu Luo、Zhaoqin Huang、Jinming Yu、Xiangjiao Meng：PD-1與PD-L1抑制劑分別結合哪一側</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：D"}